WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Hey guys,
I just filmed the same video two times in a row.&nbsp;

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:10.680
Sometimes things just go wrong.
The video distorted.&nbsp;

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.840
I checked out the settings.
I fixed it.&nbsp;

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:18.840
I filmed it again and then for some reason it&nbsp;
distorted again and my computer auto-upgraded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.440
itself and installed some updates&nbsp;
and then the audio settings were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.340
at 100 percent on the microphone.
And everything distorted again.&nbsp;

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:32.820
And I'm down here now to get some coffee&nbsp;
and I just wanted to share this with you.&nbsp;

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:37.500
It's like a pastor who would stand there and&nbsp;
preach his whole sermon and then go again and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.320
then he has to do it again a third time and it&nbsp;
gets tiring so you know everything here at home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.380
here doesn't happen just smoothly.
There are challenges.&nbsp;

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:51.240
But, I'm going through these challenges&nbsp;
with God that gives me strength.&nbsp;

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.200
Wanted to share that with some of you&nbsp;
who might need this message today.&nbsp;

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:56.880
Love you guys.
Bye.

